    },
    "assignees": [],
    "createdAt": "2026-08-19T16:42:00Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-08-20T09:00:00Z",
    "body": "### Steps\n\n1. `npm start`\n2. `curl localhost:3000/hello`\n\n```\nExpected: Hello, world!\nActual:   Hello, null!\n```\n\n`/hello?name=Ada` works fine.",
    "comments": [
      {
        "author": "Mira Chen",
        "authorLogin": "mirachen",
        "authorAvatar": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
        "createdAt": "2026-08-20T09:00:00Z",
        "body": "Reproduced on `main`. `/hello?name=` prints `Hello, !` too, so an empty name should get the default as well."
      }
    ]
  },
